Subject: [PATCH 5/7] radv/ps5: three experiments on waiting for the shaders: RADV_PS5_SUBMIT_IDLE, RADV_PS5_SYNC_CS, RADV_PS5_SYNC_PS

A title stopped the GPU in the first submission after the one that held the frame's compute passes, ten
times sooner with one command buffer a submission, and ran with RADV_DEBUG=syncshaders. To find which wait
it needs: RADV_PS5_SUBMIT_IDLE=1 ends each AGC submission with PS_PARTIAL_FLUSH and CS_PARTIAL_FLUSH,
before its completion; RADV_PS5_SYNC_CS=1 and RADV_PS5_SYNC_PS=1 are the halves of syncshaders, after
each dispatch and after each draw. All unset: nothing changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>

